## Q4. is the LEAST-CONTAINING map itself a coordinatewise function?
   (if it is, then 'take the least upper bound' is itself a formula,
    and the formula-versus-extremum distinction is not structural)
   mul_full  : I_out factors through (I1,I2) alone: False ; F_out factors through (F1,F2) alone: False
   add_mixed : I_out factors through (I1,I2) alone: False ; F_out factors through (F1,F2) alone: True
   sub_mixed : I_out factors through (I1,I2) alone: True ; F_out factors through (F1,F2) alone: False
